<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower, mostly 0.50 lower than Tuesday's close. Demand and Supply moderate to light. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    55.00-56.50, some early 57.00</p>
<p>US 1-2    210-220 lbs    52.00-55.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-230 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-270 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>	    270-280 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>Sows steady. Top 55.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    43.00-48.00</p>
<p>	   over 500 lbs    52.00-55.00</p>
</text>
